WEBVTT

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:08.320
Another unusable batch has been retrieved from Vega.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:14.570
The warp transport deteriorated the Rare Iguras. They're completely ruined.

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:21.370
Our motherworld, Altair.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.660
It still refuses to accept them.

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:27.780
This is stupid...

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:31.890
We will investigate the power Vega has at its disposal.

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:34.400
Jin, you're in command.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:35.770
Me?

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:37.050
Fine...

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:39.160
Kagura's gonna be a pain, though.

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.630
Control him!

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:46.270
It's his fault that the Machine Angel's true power has been awakened.

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:46.720
Where am I?

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:50.390
Mikono!

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:52.330
Sorry. Just Cayenne.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:56.380
You!

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:58.860
I'm supposed to show you around.

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:00.110
Follow me.

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:02.850
Hold on a minute!

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:04.330
What am I doing here?

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:06.040
Where's Mikono?

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:13.080
I can answer all of those questions while explaining what will happen to you.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.890
This is Neo-Deava's Holy Angel Academy.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:20.560
Here, we are trained as Elements to pilot the Aquarias.

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:22.970
Mikono was telling me about this.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:28.470
People with the potential to be Elements come here from all over the world.

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:32.850
Our mission is to destroy the Abductors as they attack from their homeworld.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.610
This is the hallway. The bathroom's right here.

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:38.230
You're walking too fast!

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:40.150
And this is the classroom.

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:40.740
Huh?

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:44.240
Look, it's him!

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:46.920
The civilian who hijacked an Aquaria!

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:48.990
So he's got an Element power?

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:51.210
Dude, he United with a girl!

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:53.510
Lucky bastard!

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:55.750
Get used to it.

00:03:56.390 --> 00:03:58.460
You're a civilian who managed to pilot an Aquaria,

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:00.820
and on top of that, you performed a mixed-gender Union.

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:03.510
Everyone's gonna be talking about you, even up in Neo-Deava.

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:06.470
And of course, the girl who was with you.

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.220
Mikono!

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.420
That's the Berlin.

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:16.750
Unions between boys and girls are strictly forbidden,

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:22.640
so at Neo-Deava, male and female Elements are always kept apart.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:27.120
Mikono is being examined on the other side of the Berlin.

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:29.940
This is the cafeteria.

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:30.580
Hold on!

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:31.290
What do you mean by examined?

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:32.950
That's all I have to tell you.

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.280
Now, how about you answer my question.

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:36.790
What?

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:38.960
What's going on between you and Mikono?

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:39.610
Huh?

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:41.800
Between us?

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:45.340
I mean, we just met yesterday, so we're not—

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:48.930
If you just met yesterday, how come she was in there with you?

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:50.950
What does that mean?

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:53.180
You think you know how she thinks?

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:55.900
Wait. Are you and Mikono...

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:58.150
You bet we are!

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:03.900
Goodbye, my first love...

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:06.030
Of course she would...

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:09.420
She's so pretty, there's no way she'd be single.

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:11.880
She's been timid since we were children.

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:13.490
Since you were children.

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:15.600
I bet you're engaged or something.

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:17.400
That's so romantic...

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:20.810
Almost everyone in the Suzushiro bloodline is an Element.

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:23.210
I am. Our parents were.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:25.730
And a noble bloodline!

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:27.160
You're perfect for each other.

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:32.890
But only my sister, Mikono, never developed any powers.

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:34.950
And your sister, to b—

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:36.770
Your sister?!

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:41.770
Having no powers made her timid and shy.

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:44.860
She was so afraid of the Abductors

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:48.280
that she wouldn't even leave the house without me.

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:49.740
You're kidding.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.780
But she told me...

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:55.580
<i>I can't stand being cooped up at home.</i>

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:58.500
<i>I have to get some sun!</i>

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:02.600
Mikono wouldn't get into an Aquaria on her own.

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:05.000
She's been a coward since birth.

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:09.650
I realize that I haven't known her for very long,

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:13.260
but I think she's changed since then.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:14.180
What?

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:19.660
Mikono's trying hard to change herself!

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:25.120
I mean, that's... what I think... kinda?

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:26.940
How's it sound to you, Mr. Mikono's Older Brother?

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:27.870
How dare you?

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:28.450
Hey!

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:31.820
Keep the noise down on school grounds,

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:35.080
or I'll twist you like spaghetti.

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:36.420
Professor Donar!

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:37.330
Professor?!

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:40.350
Listen, redhead.

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:42.990
We're gonna be testing you this afternoon.

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:44.210
You'd better eat up.

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:49.810
This test will determine
whether we're keeping you here or not.

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:51.720
as an Element pilot.

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:55.000
You're making me an Element pilot for one of the Aquarias?

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:57.000
No. Not an Aquaria.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:59.600
You've gone and undone the seal.

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:02.610
You're gonna pilot Aquarion.

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:14.120
Currently, there's nothing particularly wrong with his body.

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:17.760
It looks like his Element power is antigravity.

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:22.750
Whenever he experiences a sudden surge in emotion, his body floats upwards.

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:32.260
Too much!

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:36.010
So you could say he's anything but down to earth.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:41.020
But flying doesn't explain how he broke the Guize Stones' barrier.

00:07:41.550 --> 00:07:44.100
There must be a reason other than his Element power.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.380
It doesn't matter.

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:53.390
That forbidden Aquarion is all we have to combat such powerful foes.

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:55.730
I'm afraid I can't agree, Principal.

00:07:56.240 --> 00:08:00.120
We would only cause the disaster to repeat itself!

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:02.420
What disaster?

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:08.380
Excuse me, but what is this?

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:12.590
Just relax and accept whatever you see.

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:17.260
He called out Aquarion's true name,

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:22.980
controlled Evol, an unknown machine, in his first battle,

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:25.310
and defeated an enemy.

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:32.990
Memories of Aquarion sleep deep inside him.

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:41.990
Light level falling to 20,000 and stabilizing.

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:43.790
Confirmed.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.000
The waveform is changing from magenta to cyan.

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:56.220
No! Wait! Don't leave me behind!

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:03.980
No! Stop! Don't be scared!

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:10.770
No!

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:16.010
Don't go away!

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:27.070
Oh, no! Emergency halt!

00:09:27.070 --> 00:09:28.170
What just happened?

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:32.380
It looks like something is interfering with the scanner!

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:36.320
As a result, further mental probing is impossible!

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:39.710
Interfering?

00:09:44.090 --> 00:09:47.900
Did you hear about the Union between boys and girls?!

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:51.170
Yeah! Zessica was in it!

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:56.150
But only the skirts are short.

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:00.370
You're amazing, Zessica!

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:04.060
You got to Unite with boys! I'm so jealous!

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:06.140
And with Cayenne, too!

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:09.220
I know Cayenne's always number two in everything,

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:10.600
but he's so cool!

00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:15.670
I'm a Shrade fan, but they never let him into the mock battles.

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.670
Don't worry. We'll get to leave soon.

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:22.010
They'll examine me and discover I don't have any Element powers.

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:29.940
All of the other girls here have Element powers.

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:34.460
So how did Uniting with a boy feel?

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:38.530
It was definitely more... intense?

00:10:39.550 --> 00:10:41.410
I knew it! Totally called it!

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:43.830
I wanna Unite with a boy, too!

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:46.600
Actually, I'd settle for just meeting Cayenne!

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:49.540
If only the Berlin would fall down!

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:50.540
Enough!

00:10:54.890 --> 00:10:59.100
The Berlin is very important! It's there to protect us!

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:02.010
We need it! We couldn't possibly be without it!

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:03.420
Aw...

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:06.140
Come on, Mix. Lighten up a—

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:07.320
Quiet!

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:08.850
You've been tainted by those boys!

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:09.560
What?

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:11.160
Tainted?

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:13.620
Are you saying Cayenne is tainted?

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:14.630
You fools.

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:17.730
Mikono Suzushiro!

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:21.090
Did she say Suzushiro?

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:23.120
She's Cayenne Suzushiro's sister?

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:24.490
No way!

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:30.460
Mikono! Tell them that your brother is just as tainted as the rest of them!

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:33.920
Maybe he keeps porn mags under his bed, or...

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.340
I don't know.

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:38.220
I don't live with Cayenne anymore.

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:39.730
What do you mean?

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:41.130
You're a Suzushiro.

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:43.180
You have an Element power, don't you?

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:48.660
Element siblings usually have a
naturally high telepathic resonance.

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:50.150
Even if you're apart, you should be able to tell through—

00:11:50.150 --> 00:11:50.940
I can't!

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:53.810
I can't tell.

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:56.630
I'm not like Cayenne.

00:11:57.490 --> 00:11:59.030
I'm just useless.

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:22.720
A Serenade of Regret.

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:28.550
Mikono's on the other side of that wall.

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:33.670
She's so close, but they won't even let me see her.

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:39.550
A piano?

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:56.550
It's coming from over there.

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:04.630
Who's there?

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:09.810
Well, well. You're the new kid everyone's talking about.

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:11.900
Dig in.

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:14.600
Nothing like sharing a meal in a hole.

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:15.980
Uh, thanks.

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:22.650
So why is there a hole here?

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:25.820
It's the road to hope!

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.150
Hope?

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:30.730
Uh, okay... Did you dig this by yourself?

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:37.500
There it is.

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:44.860
Did you just... feel the earth?

00:13:44.860 --> 00:13:47.940
Yep. That's my Element power.

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:49.470
Your Element power?

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.310
Not just dirt, either.

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:53.930
No matter what it's made of, everything has a weak point.

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:56.990
Its just begging somebody to dig a hole in it!

00:13:56.990 --> 00:14:02.160
My power is to find those spots and grant them their desire!

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:07.460
So there are others like me here.

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:09.980
Come on!

00:14:09.980 --> 00:14:11.680
Let's dig and dig until we've got ourselves a tunnel!

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:13.880
And then we'll thrust our way into the girls' side!

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:15.030
The girls' side?

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:17.760
That's where this hole goes?

00:14:17.760 --> 00:14:22.880
Ha! You wanna help me dig my hole to bliss?

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:25.380
I do... I think.

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:28.730
I'm so glad someone's with me on this!

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:30.890
My name is Andy W. Hol.

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:34.030
We are now officially digging bros!

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:36.350
Digging bros?

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:38.850
Come on, Bro! Let's dig!

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:46.990
I... I want to see Mikono!

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:55.990
What a beautiful song.

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:01.280
Amata...

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:05.070
I hope he's somewhere here.

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:08.690
He must be.

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:11.800
It felt so natural to talk to him.

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:15.680
I've never felt so close to anyone before.

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:17.640
But I was wrong.

00:15:18.610 --> 00:15:20.540
Amata was chosen.

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:24.700
And I...

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:32.820
And so we thrust our way in!

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.240
We did it, Bro!

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:43.870
Amata?

00:15:43.870 --> 00:15:46.040
Mikono.

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:57.600
No! Let me down!

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:00.270
Mikono! Stop squirming!

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:03.330
Let go! Let go!

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:13.980
I didn't expect you to dig that deep.

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:15.780
You're something else, man.

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:18.530
That's not what I...

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:23.250
Amata, you creep!

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:24.960
Mikono!

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:32.640
Hey, don't let it get you down.

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:34.590
It happens to everybody.

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:39.100
You get your head stuck in a skirt, and you fly around a...

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:41.790
Wait a minute. That doesn't happen to anybody.

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:46.310
Damn! Let's split, Bro!

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:56.740
It's time for our monthly public exhibition mock battle!

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:58.580
The Elements will be Andy W. Hol...

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:00.790
Cayenne Suzushiro...

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:06.830
And as the head, new student Amata Sora!

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:08.530
Not Cayenne?

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:23.450
I can't believe I did that to Mikono.

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:25.490
But it wasn't on purpose.

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:27.850
I have to apologize and clear things up.

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:30.440
Simulation start!

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.740
Time to Unite, Amata!

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:43.570
Amata Sora's spirit level is remaining low!

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:45.680
Union will be impossible!

00:17:45.680 --> 00:17:48.000
Unite, damn you!

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:50.000
Come on, Amata!

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:54.210
I know you want to Unite with girls again, but now's not the time!

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:56.010
That's not what I—

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:05.000
You imbecile! If you keep flying away from the enemy, we'll never even get to Unite!

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:07.650
Pathetic.

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:11.440
It's hard to believe that's the boy
who broke the Guize Stones' seal.

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:14.730
What's the matter, Amata Sora?

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:17.380
Goddamn it!

00:18:17.380 --> 00:18:22.780
This is my first battle in three months and I can't do so much as wave to the crowd?

00:18:23.350 --> 00:18:24.340
What crowd?

00:18:24.340 --> 00:18:27.140
You realize the girls are watching our mock battle, right?

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:30.770
What are they doing?

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:31.810
This is boring.

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:32.860
Can we go yet?

00:18:32.860 --> 00:18:34.170
Everyone, quiet!

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:37.880
It's just like I said. The boys can't do a thing.

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:41.260
If Cayenne goes down, it's his fault!

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:45.120
Mikono's watching us.

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:47.910
Stay focused!

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:52.610
I want to tell Mikono!

00:18:54.930 --> 00:18:57.400
Amata Sora's spirit level is rising rapidly!

00:18:58.460 --> 00:19:00.160
He's finally in the game!

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:05.340
Spiritual Union!

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:08.540
Go! Aquarion!

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:34.020
Whoa!

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:36.780
But how's he going to recover after all that?

00:19:41.710 --> 00:19:43.570
Show us, Amata Sora.

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:46.410
Show us how deep your power goes!

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:51.310
Mikono.

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:57.050
Mikono!

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:00.770
This is his flight power!

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:02.180
Such rapid acceleration!

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:07.440
That Aquaria is flying!

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:08.400
Amata...

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:12.890
Let's show 'em!

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:14.940
Don't forget to impress the crowd, Amata!

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:17.690
Mikono! Please...

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:25.820
Accept my feelings!

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:40.960
What did he do?

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:44.670
A defensive stance that reflects all incoming attacks!

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:46.470
Not quite.

00:20:46.880 --> 00:20:48.220
He's...

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:54.770
Bowing his head.

00:21:09.820 --> 00:21:13.330
The program's throwing errors because of Amata's unexpected move!

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:15.770
Killing the simulation!

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:19.650
It's over already?

00:21:19.650 --> 00:21:21.850
That wasn't a good show at all!

00:21:21.850 --> 00:21:24.700
I'm going to have a word with you later!

00:21:26.130 --> 00:21:31.120
He... He... I don't even...

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:32.930
Amata Sora...

00:22:02.530 --> 00:22:07.550
Time for a pilgrimage to the holy land.

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:14.830
It's been two years since we took over the warp roads.

00:22:14.830 --> 00:22:17.120
He has to wake up soon.

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:22.380
He may have served us well before, but now he sleeps, and the world turns without him.

00:22:26.530 --> 00:22:29.400
That geezer Izumo is getting serious.

00:22:30.350 --> 00:22:34.170
You should probably wake up soon, Mikage.

00:24:19.840 --> 00:24:25.010
Next time on Aquarion Evol: Wall ~ Conquer Oneself ~.
